<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Morgan starts real estate firms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Morgan starts real estate firms.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Highwoods Properties Inc, Beacon Properties Corp and Crescent Real Estate Equities Inc with outperform.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage also initiated coverage of Spieker Properties Inc, Security Capital Industrial Trust and Liberty Property Trust with neutral.</p>
<p>-- Highwoods shares rose 1/2 to 31-3/4, a new year high.</p>
<p>-- Beacon shares slipped 1/8 to 31-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Crescent lost 1/8 to 43-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Spieker rose 1/4 to 30-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Security Capital rose 1/8 to 19-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Liberty Property fell 1/8 to 23-1/2.</p>
</text>
